[{"id": 7782, "uuid": "590d021f-8c2a-480c-8beb-d064e265fece", "hitokoto": "故事不是人生指南，你喜欢，可能只是你遇过。", "type": "f", "from": "杂乱无章", "from_who": "mess up", "creator": "茶褐", "creator_uid": 11611, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1646329678", "length": 21}, {"id": 7787, "uuid": "4641f6ba-347d-4756-9304-581c6175c8a4", "hitokoto": "我要做一颗星星，有棱有角，还会发光。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "陈弋函", "creator_uid": 10950, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1646528961", "length": 18}, {"id": 7790, "uuid": "8f9c00fa-04df-4ba2-8796-7b21e78acd24", "hitokoto": "Yesterday you said tomorrow.", "type": "f", "from": "NIKE广告", "from_who": "NIKE", "creator": "kw", "creator_uid": 11702, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1646983169", "length": 28}, {"id": 7839, "uuid": "7dfe4e2d-3041-4594-a24c-347a130de4da", "hitokoto": "生活先给予你希望，然后是绝望。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "清巳星嵐", "creator": "kiyomiseran", "creator_uid": 11730, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1647223516", "length": 15}, {"id": 7840, "uuid": "8350d829-dec4-435a-aeeb-effd7e5eb388", "hitokoto": "习惯性的回头，想起你已经不在了。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "清巳星嵐", "creator": "kiyomiseran", "creator_uid": 11730, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1647223696", "length": 16}, {"id": 7842, "uuid": "1742ed8e-a304-4376-bdca-ba05741db342", "hitokoto": "穹顶之下，仰望繁星。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "清巳星嵐", "creator": "kiyomiseran", "creator_uid": 11730, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1648293094", "length": 10}, {"id": 7858, "uuid": "bac7068a-b09f-445e-ba54-5c68c16ab5f8", "hitokoto": "忘掉拥有过的花，去种有结果的树。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "明天", "creator_uid": 11923, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1649483159", "length": 16}, {"id": 7862, "uuid": "bc31ca42-16d2-4dd5-bf74-8fb4f00eda61", "hitokoto": "趁天空不注意，劫持一点晚霞送给你。", "type": "f", "from": "评论", "from_who": "匿名", "creator": "小果子吖", "creator_uid": 11964, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1649569378", "length": 17}, {"id": 7925, "uuid": "f2f69fd6-16fc-4e79-afc0-d317230e1852", "hitokoto": "所有的偶然，不过是想要遇见你。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "Saliva", "creator_uid": 12638, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1658117436", "length": 15}, {"id": 7927, "uuid": "8bd21ca0-da6a-42e0-a9fb-c36948de0791", "hitokoto": "我问风扇我丑吗，风扇摇了一晚上头。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "小白的更", "creator_uid": 12608, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1657795951", "length": 17}, {"id": 7958, "uuid": "f1e56e9f-0291-446e-af29-1f91894e1700", "hitokoto": "没有激流就称不上勇进，没有山峰就谈不上攀登。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "企鹅之魂", "creator_uid": 12432, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1655740796", "length": 22}, {"id": 7970, "uuid": "2faec969-99be-4b41-ae4b-9d79b4ea44f1", "hitokoto": "顺为凡，逆则仙，只在心中一念间……", "type": "f", "from": "仙逆", "from_who": "耳根", "creator": "余空", "creator_uid": 9621, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1625303902", "length": 17}, {"id": 7971, "uuid": "f01138bc-c285-4d08-be41-77de46e04890", "hitokoto": "往昔红颜梦，今朝朦胧泪。", "type": "f", "from": "仙逆", "from_who": "耳根", "creator": "余空", "creator_uid": 9621, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1625303983", "length": 12}, {"id": 7973, "uuid": "90470e75-b143-4bec-9fd8-08f34775d6fa", "hitokoto": "The wrong person teaches you to grow up, the right person accompanies you to grow up.", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "姜堰", "creator_uid": 9562, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1624458639", "length": 85}, {"id": 7977, "uuid": "a6d43a7c-bd21-4fc9-8594-0d6ae3545f7c", "hitokoto": "岁月亦没有等我，你......何时来带我走......", "type": "f", "from": "仙逆", "from_who": "耳根", "creator": "余空", "creator_uid": 9621, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1625304401", "length": 27}, {"id": 7991, "uuid": "9c810120-be7c-4a48-8a96-0742c9d00f1b", "hitokoto": "有些关心是见不得光的，它们必须要隐藏在角落。哪怕是双向的暗自关怀也不能拿上台面，默契的确有，但感情到头也只剩下这点默契了。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "jiaohaosheng", "creator": "haoge", "creator_uid": 12220, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1651405744", "length": 61}, {"id": 7994, "uuid": "4edce07c-ab89-4045-b3a6-149f10ba0c55", "hitokoto": "世界上有很多真实的爱情，它们发生的时候都是真的，但让人悲伤的是，它们改变的时候、消失的时候，也是真的。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "网络", "creator": "RGZZJQR", "creator_uid": 12206, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1651291010", "length": 51}, {"id": 8004, "uuid": "d3abc428-9a93-4553-9ace-b6c54d183e7f", "hitokoto": "活的不快乐，本质上源于自己的无能。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "匿名", "creator": "imfycc", "creator_uid": 9162, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1621080051", "length": 17}, {"id": 8008, "uuid": "e1091d9c-5964-4f92-a418-1d134cb71f3f", "hitokoto": "修道者，逆天而行，注定要一生孤独。", "type": "f", "from": "仙逆", "from_who": "耳根", "creator": "余空", "creator_uid": 9621, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1625304229", "length": 17}, {"id": 8009, "uuid": "e2fc1273-f677-4bd2-a4d1-f1805d1a4e0e", "hitokoto": "不做无情的仙，只做有情的人！", "type": "f", "from": "仙逆", "from_who": "耳根", "creator": "余空", "creator_uid": 9621, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1625303889", "length": 14}, {"id": 8014, "uuid": "e24c6d29-f303-4cd0-b3f5-adabc3fd8b3b", "hitokoto": "你是真不知道努力变优秀的人生有多爽，还是，你早就接受了所谓命运的安排？", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "imfycc", "creator_uid": 9162, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1621612724", "length": 35}, {"id": 8015, "uuid": "88472b4b-17bc-41dd-9a6b-b8f839633c97", "hitokoto": "你真的，不打算用自己喜欢的方式去过这一生吗？", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "imfycc", "creator_uid": 9162, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1621612755", "length": 22}, {"id": 8033, "uuid": "75a4ffef-3c63-4a0d-b170-f329f9cfac4a", "hitokoto": "找不到自己的位置，是很可怕的事情，就好比天黑了不知道睡觉。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "混沌喵", "creator_uid": 12689, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1658465169", "length": 29}, {"id": 8048, "uuid": "79b721fd-a988-4263-a4b6-858ed08ed861", "hitokoto": "缘起，我在人群中看你；缘灭，我看你在人群中。", "type": "f", "from": "快手", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "•᷄ࡇ•᷅", "creator_uid": 11568, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1653315489", "length": 22}, {"id": 8049, "uuid": "5f50f43a-01f9-4e87-9af4-250830842d74", "hitokoto": "我知道我无法主宰一切，但此时此刻，我是活着的。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "DOKI", "creator_uid": 12009, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1649852390", "length": 23}, {"id": 8060, "uuid": "051c266b-03a7-4eaa-b831-09ce1372a432", "hitokoto": "神把黑暗中跳舞的心脏叫做月亮。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "凉墨", "creator_uid": 9409, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1622269007", "length": 15}, {"id": 8068, "uuid": "99c01b12-fedb-428f-aced-c9b1d114e9e6", "hitokoto": "我站在阳台抽烟，我吸一口，风也吸一口，可能风也有烦恼吧。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "sdarlin", "creator_uid": 10022, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1628330719", "length": 28}, {"id": 8078, "uuid": "b6de4663-ac80-46fd-8dd3-d46941737f96", "hitokoto": "生命在于折腾，长寿源于静止。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "Bingeone", "creator_uid": 10288, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1630415958", "length": 14}, {"id": 8079, "uuid": "961726ad-7bd6-4274-a85a-ab1b22c4b9f0", "hitokoto": "也不知道你是不是喜欢我，但你真的做了很多让我觉得你喜欢又不喜欢我的事，随便吧，我只想睡觉。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "Soiltary、K", "creator_uid": 3915, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1630905836", "length": 45}, {"id": 8088, "uuid": "2c19c04c-9735-495b-af1d-f6258d68c977", "hitokoto": "和谐的生活离不开摸头和被摸头。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "豆瓣网友", "creator": "OneCarrot", "creator_uid": 11671, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1660532284", "length": 15}, {"id": 8095, "uuid": "24027c7a-24a5-4fca-ae50-c1ba05a9f631", "hitokoto": "少年的肩膀，要挑起清风明月和草长莺飞，请成为永远疯狂永远浪漫永远清澈的存在！", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "CD_Mking", "creator_uid": 12752, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1659432249", "length": 38}, {"id": 8108, "uuid": "6b3e4508-cbc7-44f1-bd00-e7509ce52d24", "hitokoto": "不要一遇沙漠，就怀疑生命绿洲的存在；不要一遇到困难，就怀疑人生目标的实现。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "吴彦祖", "creator_uid": 12665, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1658228498", "length": 37}, {"id": 8121, "uuid": "57daf82e-3c77-4595-bdd3-81ee79515a36", "hitokoto": "所有的梦想最开始都是灰色，想蜕变为五彩斑斓的花朵，需要时间和努力的教官。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "企鹅之魂", "creator_uid": 12432, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1655382791", "length": 36}, {"id": 8128, "uuid": "33737262-9766-4f0d-8101-2cf28a2ce465", "hitokoto": "尊严，只在剑锋之上；真理，只在大炮射程之内！", "type": "f", "from": "艾跃进教授", "from_who": "艾跃进教授", "creator": "西瓜暴徒", "creator_uid": 9337, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1621588490", "length": 22}, {"id": 8152, "uuid": "69d1386f-b481-47ec-bd66-a5675128594a", "hitokoto": "当一束光照进黑暗，那就有罪，但如果这束光不离开，那便是救赎。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "青春杂货铺", "creator": "雅涵凝", "creator_uid": 4692, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1632637440", "length": 30}, {"id": 8157, "uuid": "52e9072f-cfe9-46aa-9f48-063d7a6b628a", "hitokoto": "等到功成名就的一天，日月山川都来祝贺。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "Norlder", "creator_uid": 10531, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1634135507", "length": 19}, {"id": 8162, "uuid": "2da71278-3700-49fd-b52a-9266cd599563", "hitokoto": "面具戴久了，就会长在脸上哦。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "cancan2333_", "creator_uid": 10773, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1636542408", "length": 14}, {"id": 8186, "uuid": "cc509461-7042-4bef-b5c9-ccd343f4adfc", "hitokoto": "十八成年亦乘风。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "佳", "creator_uid": 11148, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1640884638", "length": 8}, {"id": 8201, "uuid": "f277f39b-935c-4646-8cf3-efeb5501c3ec", "hitokoto": "撸起袖子加油干。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "yuanziyu", "creator_uid": 11315, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1644756468", "length": 8}, {"id": 8259, "uuid": "f6eafc78-ef87-46dd-9b90-c87bf771387c", "hitokoto": "此后人间应如是，天南海北不相逢。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "知足常乐", "creator": "过客", "creator_uid": 12767, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1659591369", "length": 16}, {"id": 8266, "uuid": "ad871695-d71a-4275-86a0-ad37856262e5", "hitokoto": "这个世界的人都渐渐变得寂寞，大城市没有邻里之喜，只有小家的柴米油盐。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "混沌喵", "creator_uid": 12689, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1658465076", "length": 34}, {"id": 8267, "uuid": "4a202e7c-da4e-4257-b177-d4d9d292f3b7", "hitokoto": "精神生活的难是，辘辘饥肠算不上什么，比起目标迷茫的前景同时没有任何成就感。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "混沌喵", "creator_uid": 12689, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1658465451", "length": 37}, {"id": 8271, "uuid": "9e9ada85-111e-475a-8b96-3771df547b96", "hitokoto": "我也会照顾自己，而我照顾自己的方式就是：一个人安安静静的，在角落里看自己喜欢的东西，仅此而已。", "type": "f", "from": "哔哩哔哩", "from_who": "秋彻", "creator": "Hytf233", "creator_uid": 7017, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1658407796", "length": 47}, {"id": 8290, "uuid": "0d55fdc1-9adf-42af-8c50-6087c3d9c22e", "hitokoto": "我最喜欢你的那一年，那将是我永远不会再有的十八岁。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "•᷄ࡇ•᷅", "creator_uid": 11568, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1651754699", "length": 25}, {"id": 8292, "uuid": "97438efe-1468-4838-82d6-82cf2083856c", "hitokoto": "七彩泡沫的破灭必然不是 happy ending，但也不是 bad ending，它只是 true ending 。", "type": "f", "from": "博客园", "from_who": "zx2003", "creator": "Eternal_Battle", "creator_uid": 11999, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1660119469", "length": 58}, {"id": 8312, "uuid": "41f3f9a1-dbd8-41a4-ab20-0e9c8880c925", "hitokoto": "物是旧时物，人非旧时人。", "type": "f", "from": "bilibili", "from_who": null, "creator": "jigeshuohua", "creator_uid": 10371, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1632834445", "length": 12}, {"id": 8313, "uuid": "93510f65-228e-4dd2-b4d5-9df5f4438e86", "hitokoto": "我碰到一个男孩，前几年活泼开朗，现在他满身疲惫两眼无光，我很想安慰他，于是我伸手碰了碰镜子。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "Gowninng", "creator": "gowninng", "creator_uid": 9316, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1621427230", "length": 46}, {"id": 8314, "uuid": "053e7a40-7b30-418c-ab83-0ac66036b565", "hitokoto": "被风吹奏的，总是那飘忽的哀愁；只有那无心人的寂寞，是风，怎么也吹不散的烟火。", "type": "f", "from": "求魔", "from_who": "耳根", "creator": "余空", "creator_uid": 9621, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1625305327", "length": 38}, {"id": 8317, "uuid": "f3089f50-0632-4f4e-9b43-6da79ffdefa6", "hitokoto": "若不追忆，则从此听不到那年华里，谁的叹息。", "type": "f", "from": "求魔", "from_who": "耳根", "creator": "余空", "creator_uid": 9621, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1625305566", "length": 21}, {"id": 8327, "uuid": "9e969016-5a92-4db3-b51a-41a3c948dc7f", "hitokoto": "一个人，应该有力量，将自己从一切沉重的、老旧的、无精打采的事物里拔出来，用不断地尝试、变通改变自己的境遇。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "匿名", "creator": "imfycc", "creator_uid": 9162, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1621080095", "length": 53}, {"id": 8328, "uuid": "ef8ec994-34d2-4bcb-a237-c50a09f1aa87", "hitokoto": "想要更多的力量，去爱这个世界。", "type": "f", "from": "微博", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "OooooMG_OU", "creator_uid": 9313, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1621419126", "length": 15}, {"id": 8330, "uuid": "25c6bc85-896e-4ef8-baa2-fc84b63a479c", "hitokoto": "相爱不需要技巧，但是相处需要。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "eaea", "creator_uid": 304, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1623852128", "length": 15}, {"id": 8331, "uuid": "97b1cb4d-e627-4075-a7e1-fd264b79afbe", "hitokoto": "前世修来的缘，凝聚了数千年，方可修得一次我亲自为你摆着船桨，带着你走过那条叫做忘川的河，渡着你……去往彼岸。", "type": "f", "from": "求魔", "from_who": "耳根", "creator": "余空", "creator_uid": 9621, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1625305392", "length": 54}, {"id": 8332, "uuid": "deefa960-29c3-4282-b4b8-bc5c8c0b37dd", "hitokoto": "一样花开一千年，独看沧海化桑田；一笑望穿一千年，几回知君到人间。", "type": "f", "from": "求魔", "from_who": "耳根", "creator": "余空", "creator_uid": 9621, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1625305505", "length": 32}, {"id": 8333, "uuid": "871cb266-4146-4c28-826c-d8a9d447bcc4", "hitokoto": "生有涯，知无涯，轮回几多道无涯；地有边，天无边，生死几许念无边。", "type": "f", "from": "求魔", "from_who": "耳根", "creator": "余空", "creator_uid": 9621, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1625305440", "length": 32}, {"id": 8344, "uuid": "e4729849-cb94-444d-9bff-bb1004f7b2a3", "hitokoto": "梧高凤必至，花香蝶自来。", "type": "f", "from": "百度", "from_who": "兔子君", "creator": "兔子君", "creator_uid": 9987, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1628172900", "length": 12}, {"id": 8391, "uuid": "3e4d48ff-5ae7-4d16-ab52-8a60de3d25c6", "hitokoto": "他乡纵有当头月，不及故乡一盏灯。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "闫浔", "creator": "止境", "creator_uid": 9684, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1641966411", "length": 16}, {"id": 8414, "uuid": "4c17af17-36a6-47a5-ace2-74273537660b", "hitokoto": "山海自有归期，风雨自有相逢，意难平终将和解，万事终将如意。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "•᷄ࡇ•᷅", "creator_uid": 11568, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1647786406", "length": 29}, {"id": 8422, "uuid": "ba7c1baf-e251-4268-9b53-24a679bf4257", "hitokoto": "远赴人间惊鸿宴，一睹大唐盛世颜。", "type": "f", "from": "杂句", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "•᷄ࡇ•᷅", "creator_uid": 11568, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1648311631", "length": 16}, {"id": 8424, "uuid": "ebe5c739-5c08-48e7-93ad-45d3f1823c85", "hitokoto": "晚上我突然被同桌叫醒，我看着熟悉而又陌生的同学们我激动的告诉他们我做了一个很长的梦。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "•᷄ࡇ•᷅", "creator_uid": 11568, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1648540153", "length": 42}, {"id": 8429, "uuid": "07db5b25-8f91-447d-856e-15d50fa6ff0f", "hitokoto": "大病初愈无人迎，久别重逢隔岸观，失而复得已无用，虚惊一场梦方醒，不期而遇无言语，如约而至没好事，未来可期愿低许", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "•᷄ࡇ•᷅", "creator_uid": 11568, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1648205963", "length": 55}, {"id": 8443, "uuid": "51b4e12f-f2de-4585-acb4-3c0b1db4bee8", "hitokoto": "宇宙中只有一个地球，毁掉它容易，回头路难走。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "第五薰", "creator": "D5xun", "creator_uid": 12014, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1649906683", "length": 22}, {"id": 8444, "uuid": "9b2335bb-8cbf-4dcc-b5d6-841691717e46", "hitokoto": "我以为可以置身事外，后来我才发现，其实……没有人可以独善其身。所有人都在这场风波中，越陷越深，最后被卷入风暴中心，尸骨无存。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "第五薰", "creator": "D5xun", "creator_uid": 12014, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1649906733", "length": 62}, {"id": 8449, "uuid": "4e1f6cde-8857-4301-802f-c3c6f87ffa66", "hitokoto": "其实每个女孩身边都有张万森，只是女孩不想承认罢了。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "•᷄ࡇ•᷅", "creator_uid": 11568, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1650123003", "length": 25}, {"id": 8452, "uuid": "0981b82b-c90a-4419-ac7d-75f3871a95bb", "hitokoto": "时间是件无价的易耗品，不管你愿不愿意，它总是被消耗着。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "路明非", "creator_uid": 12065, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1650259663", "length": 27}, {"id": 8463, "uuid": "812f947b-29c9-4f58-b406-4fc2bb1b3bbd", "hitokoto": "我们现在所做的，只是自认为是动态规划的贪心罢了。", "type": "f", "from": "博客园", "from_who": "Varuxnn", "creator": "Eternal_Battle", "creator_uid": 11999, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1660119511", "length": 24}, {"id": 8467, "uuid": "5d0b22ff-4b19-49e3-94eb-1775845beada", "hitokoto": "不要悲观地想会比较好吧……因为人生只有一次而已；无论发生什么事，只要做就行了。", "type": "f", "from": "niconico", "from_who": "zun", "creator": "逢坂Taiga大河", "creator_uid": 12231, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1651467445", "length": 39}, {"id": 8471, "uuid": "5d34f4dc-7ea1-4283-84fe-446da322edf2", "hitokoto": "今年夏，遇一人，甚喜之，我无能，未能留之。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "小杨", "creator_uid": 12865, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1660662430", "length": 21}, {"id": 8479, "uuid": "e7d5cd6b-2fd9-4eb3-9581-a7c9e9c929f4", "hitokoto": "智者不入爱河，遇你不做智者。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "永远", "creator_uid": 12322, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1652335798", "length": 14}, {"id": 8482, "uuid": "86bec6b8-16ac-45fb-b967-983644a82f5e", "hitokoto": "充其量只是好奇罢了。", "type": "f", "from": "bilibili", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "jigeshuohua", "creator_uid": 10371, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1632834473", "length": 10}, {"id": 8483, "uuid": "f69aabc3-122d-4fb6-b752-455c80bca4a9", "hitokoto": "你无法同时拥有青春和对青春的感受。", "type": "f", "from": "bilibili", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "jigeshuohua", "creator_uid": 10371, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1632834495", "length": 17}, {"id": 8484, "uuid": "feba7900-039f-4c65-b69a-eda6aeca5de9", "hitokoto": "跟喜欢的人是做不了朋友的，距离远近都是折磨。", "type": "f", "from": "bilibili", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "jigeshuohua", "creator_uid": 10371, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1632834553", "length": 22}, {"id": 8485, "uuid": "2bde16ee-a01b-4259-ae4d-43e5b2939208", "hitokoto": "我清楚知道我跟你中间有一张没捅破的纸，一堵危耸的墙，一段懵懂的青春。", "type": "f", "from": "bilibili", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "jigeshuohua", "creator_uid": 10371, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1632834535", "length": 34}, {"id": 8486, "uuid": "fb0f4f15-84f2-4766-a962-3c60acb623c8", "hitokoto": "有意义的人等再久都有意义。", "type": "f", "from": "bilibili", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "jigeshuohua", "creator_uid": 10371, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1632834631", "length": 13}, {"id": 8487, "uuid": "689465f7-5dde-4df6-8971-95b94add337d", "hitokoto": "做人潇洒一点，别为了一个不爱你的人浪费感情。", "type": "f", "from": "bilibili", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "jigeshuohua", "creator_uid": 10371, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1632834687", "length": 22}, {"id": 8488, "uuid": "19f688d6-7128-4142-b61c-28ae47d746d5", "hitokoto": "其实我没有什么忘不掉的人，只是始终对自己那场没有结果的付出和被浪费的爱耿耿于怀。", "type": "f", "from": "bilibili", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "jigeshuohua", "creator_uid": 10371, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1632834926", "length": 40}, {"id": 8489, "uuid": "71b0fb3a-5f96-4f50-ba8f-2599b48634cd", "hitokoto": "直到看见她和别人恋爱的模样，才发现自己从来没被爱过。", "type": "f", "from": "bilibili", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "jigeshuohua", "creator_uid": 10371, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1632834592", "length": 26}, {"id": 8496, "uuid": "cc8bd35c-cc13-45c2-a422-393e0abeea6c", "hitokoto": "人为什么要努力？因为怕有朝一日，普通的我，遇见特别的你！", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "baresi48", "creator_uid": 10455, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1632362797", "length": 28}, {"id": 8497, "uuid": "a3891563-f09b-41c9-ac26-d98cf1045eb6", "hitokoto": "当痛苦绵延不绝，当欲望与日俱增，命运其实正在告诉你：嗨，改变的时候到了。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "baresi48", "creator_uid": 10455, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1632364155", "length": 36}, {"id": 8498, "uuid": "c8f2e898-c9c6-4e27-8a8d-c2dd1749ef32", "hitokoto": "还好还可以想你，不然拿什么对抗生活的琐碎和无趣。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "无聊的game", "creator_uid": 10376, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1631368168", "length": 24}, {"id": 8499, "uuid": "92ff8be0-41c2-45e5-8a2b-c5487dddace4", "hitokoto": "远赴人间惊鸿宴 ，一睹人间盛世颜。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "无聊的game", "creator_uid": 10376, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1631367987", "length": 17}, {"id": 8500, "uuid": "d91b73b7-e2b1-4266-8cb0-40470533e06b", "hitokoto": "祝你此生，梦想光芒，野蛮生长，永不彷徨。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "无聊的game", "creator_uid": 10376, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1631368201", "length": 20}, {"id": 8501, "uuid": "e39d04ba-5cc1-4c36-a9e7-bf00737f43a4", "hitokoto": "你就是盛开着的，漫山遍野的温柔。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "无聊的game", "creator_uid": 10376, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1631368218", "length": 16}, {"id": 8502, "uuid": "e5480716-3964-4afa-901b-fa6e5bc2daf0", "hitokoto": "想要让每一天重新来过，又不想让仔细回味每一天。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "NriotHrreion", "creator_uid": 3661, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1631787326", "length": 23}, {"id": 8507, "uuid": "32d0149c-d161-43b3-8482-a9b5c030cc1b", "hitokoto": "回望过去，无论何时何事，总会嘲笑当时的愚蠢，但又会敬佩当初的那股热情和冲动。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "Sad_slime", "creator_uid": 10353, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1631020060", "length": 38}, {"id": 8509, "uuid": "9f4f5ded-2d9a-45d0-8e2c-e9f5ffa42c5d", "hitokoto": "命由己造，相由心生。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "渡鸦", "creator_uid": 10346, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1630988515", "length": 10}, {"id": 8510, "uuid": "20c2faaf-b964-4c08-a65f-da02e3cf14ae", "hitokoto": "一阴一阳之谓道，乐天知命故不忧。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "渡鸦", "creator_uid": 10346, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1630988580", "length": 16}, {"id": 8511, "uuid": "0af53ed2-e7b8-4b79-972a-1ead74c379ed", "hitokoto": "苍天有眼，命数天定，但行好事，莫问前程。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "渡鸦", "creator_uid": 10346, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1630988445", "length": 20}